hpc:Jobaffinity a owl:Class .
hpc:jobaffinitysamecu a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Jobaffinity ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Job .
hpc:jobaffinitydifferentcu a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Jobaffinity ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Job .

# Cluster Affinity
hpc:Clusteraffinity a owl:Class .
hpc:clusteraffinityattribute a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Clusteraffinity ;
    rdfs:range rdf:Resource .
hpc:clusteraffinityttl a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Clusteraffinity ;
    rdfs:range xsd:nonNegativeInteger .

# Job and Cluster
hpc:Job a owl:Class .
hpc:Cluster a owl:Class .


This ontology fragment defines classes for JobAffinity, ClusterAffinity, Job, and Cluster. It also defines object properties for JobAffinitySameCU and JobAffinityDifferentCU, and a datatype property for ClusterAffinityTTL. The properties are defined with their respective domains and ranges.
